# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile (context = repository root). Docker reads only the
# .dockerignore at the context root, so apps/web/.dockerignore does not apply to that build.
# Keep local state, secrets and other apps' files out of the image and out of the layer cache.
**/.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/dump.rdb
# Python app and caches: not part of the web image (pnpm ignores directories without package.json).
apps/api
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
docs
infra
